Realty Trust (SRRT):** 미국의 사모 부동산 투자신탁입니다[5].\n*   **Starwood Real Estate Income Trust (SREIT):** 스타우드 캐피탈 그룹이 운용하는 대규모 부동산 투자신탁입니다[6][7].\n*   **Global X SuperDividend® REIT ETF (SRET):** 전 세계 고배당 리츠에 투자하는 ETF입니다[8].\n*   **SRH REIT Covered Call ETF (SRHR):** 미국 상장 리츠에 투자하면서 커버드콜 전략을 사용하는 ETF입니다[9][10].\n\n찾으시는 정보가 특정 기업의 재무 정보인지, 혹은 해외 금융 상품에 대한 것인지 확인하신 후 추가로 질문해 주시면 더 정확한 답변을 드릴 수 있습니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlDX1yGdWDJGT7uQppEks0_8NGYwvUqR6F1gf_MgfDHzAuje4jFdFAl9_RZbatUA1RpELG6KV49ZFvPFnvfNArDpZx-tW7Wd7rVIF33Ssn4SiaRpakOl4P_u8cb74cYsf1Khm5w8Xaw3SHs8ZF80RweNDZYMABjbsKo1CPf_AoHGr9ZSFrwviZDxN7VjSPZghY1GQ-9z1r8LN3dZJ2M3YQIE_Cl7Ayw-N8ZsSoX7SFttRjUtMthybJUk0Djv_buRuksmeE7Cu7BSHtfz69smuIB_dZcUfdaw==)\n[2] [hankyung\n<truncated 5 bytes>\n(https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHgS9R1X9jKAgdqRkR3Gh3cLQGs7gdROajUSb7MLaUdseq1LG-nU7m-mvQwR7UAyQI4_XCqoHYTsRR3Ok_WXo7lyAVlMVlIMBfW7aRzTy35WmLEo7VtgWR9l8B9qIcEgFwEHU38)\n[3] [joongang.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFv6ZKuC4nTe0-oiea2KvjSflze45ptNIQZTk-tYoyGgBeOLYPi15xg2zg0QgDB3fa0lysbTE9N2zDmUKQL0zjmoGvtl4xu4RQAL3f0mQ8BK1pf_v2nXLW6UQFHDd9P4_Q=)\n[4] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUuGPG_KdJdk17_2UJM_vij9SbQ7YjRbCX8DjKZggXAUz7PYmdT8-iDa5o4HVci0d_PSYypMvsFqt3y7McUBwEwWrFo_NeO3FG6IMRwEcAwNUt__5HiDrS8pVHx7jtUqgjaR53auanhFlveS7ImPQWOQyAC-dNLOV1nXevnzWQn8y9DPPtwwDoRqeMtR0JSBppMreoyxQFUTFbECvvcfjK5d06sHwX28NsO2MaHA==)\n[5] [srrealtytrust.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF6pQ0orP-AcnwXtIk-I3G6KAohiBioRA5zT7A30M2gIkVUnYLgsrMtNDw2bLoPsx1p_R7bsu0EU_dKGSlMfM_1pcTm3EGITXlZH7KlhDoNOQ==)\n[6] [starwoodnav.reit](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHTPGg-V54xR4Tn7BK6243U-w2IfciWhbAwufbaN5p00hYxjyNh3MgEHNvmc_SnbZon6SVeDLEu-6bEOj_xicB5kuiFow1HqgnCR05E9lQ9aHgB7Q==)\n[7] 